<Items>
	<!-- bow mechanics:
		 1. Ranged weapons have item_usage values set to respective weapon 
		 2. Arrows use item_usage="arrow_right" to be notchable
		 3. Bolts do not require this and leave item_usage empty 
		 4. item_usage="long_bow" forces bow to be unable to be used while mounted
		 5. Does ammo speed effect projectile speed (crossbows no)? 
		 6. Does ammo reload effect weapon reload (crossbows no)?  
		 7. Thrust speed (crossbow) dictates how fast it takes for the weapon to shoot, no affect on aim time or reload time.
		 8. Speed rating (crossbow) doesn't do anything.
		 9. For reloading (crossbow), must add in additional action sets and modify animations to change reload time. 
		 10. Ammo limit (crossbow) is how many projectiles are loaded at once. No aiming circle after the first shot though. 
		 11. If you set a crossbow to be a bow, the aiming circle comes back for multi-load but now if you aim too long your acc decreases. 
		 5. Affects area spreads the damage out over an area. Can you modify this area? 
		 5. Can add weapon flags to crafted items (see aran_spear_blade_2 as example) 
		 5. Physics material the explosion effect
		 5. Stone throwables require ammo limit to work -->
	<Item id="aran_training_bow_a" 
